[00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.000]   Turning to our service and repair categories.
[00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.000]   We saw a 3% decline in breaks year-over-year.
[00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000]   Falling short of a difficult comparison in the third quarter last year.
[00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:29.000]   In maintenance, we were flat while front-end shocks were down 1% and alignments declined 3% year-over-year.
[00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:38.000]   Overall, our southern markets outperformed our northern markets as expected given the mild winter weather conditions we faced in this region.
[00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:46.000]   New stores added $22.7 million in revenue during the quarter including $20.7 million from recent acquisitions.
[00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:50.000]   Regarding our gross margin performance during the quarter.
