[00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.000]   Which resulted in higher fixed costs as a percentage of sales.
[00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:09.000]   Our variable margin, on the other hand, expanded due to lower year-over-year material costs as a percentage of sales.
[00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:16.000]   While slightly higher than the prior year quarter, technician labor as a percentage of sales decreased sequentially from last quarter.
[00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.000]   This is a good example of us executing well against the areas within our control.
