[00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:09.000]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by, and welcome to the Aldera Therapeutics Second Quarter 2020 Financial Results Conference Call.
[00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.420]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
