[00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:27.400]   business strategies and plans, research, development, and commercial plans,
[00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:33.760]   or expectations, trends, market sizing, competitive position, industry environment,
[00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.620]   and potential growth opportunities, among other things.
[00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:41.360]   These statements are based upon the information available to the company today.
[00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:48.100]   As a result of the COVID-19 pandemic, clinical site availability, staffing,
