[00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:27.500]   are described in greater detail in the company's press release today.
[00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:34.500]   The company's press release today is a summary of the financial results of the COVID-19 pandemic, and the company's financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2020, and the company's filings with the SEC.
